<title>ESTONIA: HOIU ASSET MANAGEMENT JAN/FEB PROFIT SIX MLN EEK.</title>
<headline>HOIU ASSET MANAGEMENT JAN/FEB PROFIT SIX MLN EEK.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank said on Friday that its asset management company made a profit of 5.9 million kroons in the first two months of 1997.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the profit was due to the healthy state of the economy.</p>
<p>But it said that due to share price falls in Russia, the March profit for the asset management company would not be so healthy.</p>
<p>It said that it had 38.3 percent market share, making it the largest asset management company in Estonia.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
